        "sid": "2KI 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Hezekia kayahuliire ebyo Rabushake yagambiire atagura enyambarwaze, ayambara orugunia, ataha omuli Rwensinga y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliakimu omusigire w'ekikaare, Shebuna omuhandiki n'abakuhani abakuru, abatuma ow'omurangi Isaya eya Amozi bajwete engunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamugambira bati, “Ogwo ni Hezekia ngu kir'eki kyaba ky'enaku, ky'okujumwa n'okujangurwa. Ngu enda zili omu mangi kyonkai amani g'okuzisindikira gayanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shana Omukama Ruhanga wawe ebyo Rabushake yagamba yabihulira, Rabushake owo Mukamawe omukama wa Asiria atumire kujangura Ruhanga asingiire. Hezekia nashubira okwo Omukama Ruhanga wawe ebigambo ebyo yahulira tabyesize kushai; aha rw'ekyo nakushaba oshabire abantu aba abasigaireho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo abaramata b'Omukama Hezekia bagobire Isaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya abagambira ati, “Mugambire omukama wanyu muti, ‘Omukama ngu ebyo wahulira bitakutinisa, eby'abaramata b'omukama wa Asiria bakujumisa otabitina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Senakeribu aramutamu omwoyo gubi, ahulire ebitalikwo, ashube owabo, bamwise embanda.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabushake ashubayo, ashanga Senakeribu narashanisa ekigo kya Libuna, kuba akaba yahuliire okwo yabaire atakili Lakishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Senakeribu kayahuliire okwo Tirihaka omukama wa Etiopia ali omu muhanda amutabaliire, atuma entumwa ahali Hezekia nagamba ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mugambire Hezekia omukama wa Yuda muti, ‘Ruhanga wawe ow'olikwesiga atakubeiya kukushubiza okwo Yerusalemu etagwe mu mikono y'omukama wa Asiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba orahuliire okwo abakama ba Asiria barakozire ensi zona bakazisilikya limoilimoi. Iwe oije orokoke? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BaRuhanga b'amahanga ago batat'enkuru basilikize, bakabarokora? Isi ebigo bya Gozani, Harani, Rezefu n'abantu ba Edeni abaturaga Telasari? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alihai omukama wa Hamati, omukama wa Aripadi, omukama w'ekigo kya Sefarivaimu, omukama wa Hena anga omukama wa Iva?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entumwa ziletera Hezekia ebarua, agishoma. Aho agya Rwensinga agishanshurulira Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashoma enshara ati, “Waitu Mukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli, iwe asingiire aha bakerubi, niwe oba Ruhanga wenkai w'engoma zona z'ensi, niwe watonzire eiguru n'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Mukama, ontege amatwi ompulire; waitu Mukama, oburure amaisho obone; ohulire ebyo Senakeribu yatuma entumwa kujumisa Ruhanga asingiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mazima, waitu Mukama, abakama ba Asiria basilikize amahanga n'ensi zago, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baRuhanga bago babanaga omu muliro, kuba bakaba batali baRuhangakwo, shana ebihuuku ebyakozirwe abantu, miti n'amabare, nikyo babisilikiize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho mbwenu waitu Mukama Ruhanga waitu, oturokore ninkutagiliza, omutujune, engoma zona z'ensi zimanye okwo iwe Ruhanga niwe oba Ruhanga wenkai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Isaya eya Amozi atumaho Hezekia ati, “Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli nagamba ati: Enshara yawe eyo wanshaba kankujuna ahali Senakeribu omukama wa Asiria nakuhulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu Omukama Ruhanga nagambira Senakeribu ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Akabonero ak'oramanyiraho nik'aka: Mwaka ogu oralya ebyemeza, omu mwaka gwa kabili oralya ebitutwire aha byemeza ebyo; kandi omu mwaka gwa kashatu mubibe mugeshe, mubyare emizabibu omu ndimiro, mushube mulye ebiraba byayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensigalira z'eka ya Yuda zirashuba zisimbe emizi, zikure zirabe ebiraba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli Yerusalemu n'aha Ibanga lya Sioni aliho abararuhonokaho bakatura omwo; kuba ekihika ky'Omukama kilikora ebyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha rw'ekyo Omukama nagamba okwo omukama wa Asiria atatahe mu kigo eki anga kurashamu mwambi, anga kukigoba akwete ngabo anga kukitera rusinde kukibunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhanda gumulesire nigwo guramugarurayo, mara talitaha mu kigo eki rundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba inye ndalinda ekigo eki nkirokore, aha rw'ekitinwa kyange n'aha rw'okuragana okwo naraganisize omwiru wange Daudi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kiro ekyo omumalaika w'Omukama ataha omu rusisira rw'Abasiria, aita abantu 185,000. Omu rukyakya abantu kabaimukire leba emitumbi egyo yona. ",
          "type": "text",
